// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 08-adt/inherent_method_discarded_mutating_trailing_neg_23.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// A discarded mutating unit call followed by a trailing mutating field-read
// call is well-formed source the discarded-call composition does not lower
// yet (it admits only a shared trailing borrow), so the caller definition
// drains as ZOM4099 instead of hitting an internal invalid-fact invariant.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4099]: this function body uses a construct the compiler cannot generate code for yet
// CHECK: 6 | fn entry() -> i32 {
